    tmk:supportingText "The examiner must consider whether a trade mark is the same as, or included in,a plant name protected under the PBR Act or if use of the trade mark would infringe the PBR, and hence whether a contrary to law ground for rejection applies under section 42 of the Trade Marks Act 1995 (TM Act)." ;
