    tmk:supportingText "3.2 Generally speaking, the deferment period ends when the application is withdrawn (subreg 4.14(2)(a)), or when the Registrar is satisfied that there are no longer any grounds for rejecting the application under subsection 44(1) or (2) of the Act and therefore withdraws the citation (subreg 4.14(2)(b)), or if these do not apply, in accordance with the rules laid down in subregulation 4.14(3)." ;
